msgstr "Weight %d · requires a one-handed weapon"

msgid "Poids de l'équipement porté"
msgstr "Weight of the equipment carried"

msgid "Pointe étroite et trempée : abîme davantage l'armure et passe un peu mieux, au prix de dégâts légèrement moindres."
msgstr "Narrow tempered point: damages armor more and penetrates a bit better, at the cost of slightly less damage."

msgid "Points de talent : %d"
msgstr "Perk points: %d"

msgid "Points de vie"
msgstr "Hit points"

msgid "Poison"
msgstr "Poison"

